I removed the redundant `GetNumSubFields()` guard and the duplicate bounds check, letting `GetSubField`'s own NULL return select the fallback, which saves a call and a comparison on the hot path.

```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 FieldBase::GetScale(const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    const FIT_SUBFIELD_INFO *subfield = GetSubField(subFieldIndex);
    return (NULL != subfield) ? subfield->scale : GetScale();
}
```